  <activityDataset>
    <activityDescription>
      <activity id="29a06c25-bd28-5a71-b707-c3be83899cbf" activityNameId="a2784e44-601e-5c89-bb5a-f49b64a60fd2" activityNameContextId="f44c43c1-5cc5-54a6-ade6-24435bd12c83" type="1" specialActivityType="0" energyValues="0">
        <activityName xml:lang="en">Door, outer, aluminium, transparent filling, at plant</activityName>
        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: Door, outer, aluminium, transparent filling, at plant
The measures of the visible door sheet are 1.0m x 2.0m. The bill of materials is based on data from 4 aluminium system houses. A weighted average was calculated with the estimated market shares of these companies. Data on production losses, work materials, packaging materials, energy demand and transports were provided by 1 producer of aluminium doors. Production losses were only available for aluminium profiles, aluminium sheets and glazing.;
UUID: 6e47c2ad-842d-3632-af32-bd9ce911dc12
Included are the materials used in an outer aluminium door with transparent filling. Production losses, work materials, packaging materials, energy demand, transports and treatment of waste materials are also included.
Location: Data apply to the supply in Switzerland.
Technology: Industry data.
Time period: Time of publications.
Production volume: na
Sampling: Data survey at 4 aluminium system houses and 1 aluminium door producer. 
Extrapolations: Some generic datasets from ecoinvent have been used.
Uncertainty adjustments: none
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_6e47c2ad-842d-3632-af32-bd9ce911dc12.xml</text>
        </generalComment>
      </activity>
